/// known-gap: interp reads a bare name in a method as the object's field
/// A bare name in a method is never the object's field: reading one that is
/// only a field is an error that points to `@name`.
<>P |
    ~hp: 5
    act show()
        say("start")
        say(hp)
    xx
xx
p <> P | hp: 5
p.show()
